# Runtime pins for the io.rapidbyte.pyjsonl proof connector — installed
# into the certification gate's venv (target/py-certify-venv, rebuilt
# whenever this file changes). Exact pins on purpose: the gate proves
# the wire against one known dependency set, not a floating one.
grpcio==1.83.0
# The vendored stubs' runtime — grpcio itself does not depend on the
# protobuf package, and the generated code refuses a runtime older than
# its generator's bundled protobuf (7.35.1 for grpcio-tools 1.83.0).
protobuf==7.35.1
# Dev/regeneration pin, deliberately NOT installed here:
#   grpcio-tools==1.83.0
# tools/check-python-stubs.sh installs it into its own scratch venv,
# regenerates the stubs from the proto, and diffs against the vendored
# pair — the stub headers name the same pin.
